# Option and schema changes are announced with the schema's labels:
# "mix" prefers the abbreviation, "long" the full label, "short" the
# abbreviation or else the first character of the full label.
!notify option ascii_mode       => status "A"
!notify option !ascii_mode      => status "中"
@status-message long
!notify option ascii_mode       => status "西文"
@status-message short
!notify option !ascii_mode      => status "中"
!notify schema scribe_test/Scribe Test  => status "Scribe Test"
# Options the schema gives no labels are not announced.
!notify option _linear          => status none
@notifications never
!notify option ascii_mode       => status none
